<title>USA: USA Waste Services Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>USA Waste Services Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Operating revenues			$364,905	  $282,525</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>     Operating				187,723	   158,956</p>
<p>     General and administrative	  42,794	    36,704</p>
<p>     Depreciation and amortization     45,589	    32,701</p>
<p>	   Total				276,106	   228,361</p>
<p> Income from operations		    88,799	    54,164</p>
<p>Other income (expense):</p>
<p>     Interest expense		    (11,957)	  (11,227)</p>
<p>     Interest and other, net		5,037	     3,145</p>
<p>	   Total				(6,920)	   (8,082)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		81,879	    46,082</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		32,752	    18,430</p>
<p> Net income				    49,127	    27,652</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		   0.32		0.21</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common</p>
<p>  equivalent shares outstanding	 159,472	   132,362</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said 1996 Q1 restated to reflect its mergers with Western Waste Industries Inc and Grand Central Sanitation Inc in May 1996, and Sanifill Inc in August 1996; mergers accounted for as poolings of interests.</p>
</text>
